    "created_at": "2024-02-29T22:18:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-29T22:18:44Z",
    "body": "A concept of event loop with real-time constraints would be a decent solution to this problem, but I think that's a rather significant change with so many uncertainties to introduce after a decade of the API launch. So without such system, the rendering loop algorithm that we have in Web Audio API is the best we can do.\r\n\r\n+1 on making it more clearer or more correct.\r\n",
