    "created_at": "2024-03-03T10:50:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-03T10:50:18Z",
    "body": "I think the problem now is that there are certain JS APIs that assume there's an event loop (as defined in the HTML Standard), but that's not the case for worklets. So either those JS features cannot work in worklets or they work in some undefined manner.\r\n\r\nIt does seem like Web Audio attempts to integrate with this maybe through the \"associated task queue\", but it doesn't seem particularly sound.",
